title Flexibility Emission Business Process

VPPaaS->Camunda: Trigger Flexibility Analysis
Camunda->Kong: Forward Request
Kong->Flexibility Service: Forward Request
activate Flexibility Service

Flexibility Service->Telemetry Service: Get latest telemetry data
activate Telemetry Service
Telemetry Service->Database: Query latest telemetry readings
Database-->Telemetry Service: Telemetry data
Telemetry Service-->Flexibility Service: Response (telemetry data)
deactivate Telemetry Service

note right of Flexibility Service: Apply rules:\nsoc_percent > 90% AND peak hours - SELL\nsoc_percent < 20% - UNAVAILABLE\ngrid_frequency_hz < 49.8 Hz - EMERGENCY_DISCHARGE\nac_voltage_v > 253 V - OVERVOLTAGE_WARNING

Flexibility Service->Database: INSERT INTO FlexibilityEvents\n(eventType, assetLinkId, gridCellId, incentiveValue, timestamp)
Database-->Flexibility Service: OK

Flexibility Service->Kafka: Publish Flexibility Event
note right of Kafka: Topic = flexibility-offers

Flexibility Service-->Kong: Response
deactivate Flexibility Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response
Camunda-->VPPaaS: Forward Response
